Packaged attribution
--------------------

`OpenCode-iOS-rootless.deb` installs a Debian-format copyright/attribution file
at /var/jb/usr/share/doc/opencode/copyright (plus LICENSE, README.md,
INSTALL.md, VERIFICATION.md and KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md), so the attribution travels
with the binary distribution.

Secrets
-------

No API keys, tokens, private keys or credentials are stored in this repository or
embedded in the package. Provider authentication is configured by the user at
runtime (`opencode auth login`) and stored in the user's home directory.
